<title>SPAIN: Spain's Abengoa said Q1 net up 18.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain's Abengoa said Q1 net up 18.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's applied engineering and equipment firm Abengoa said it had a net profit of 760 million pesetas in the first quarter 1997, 18.2 percent higher than the same period last year.</p>
<p>In a statement Abengoa added that turnover was 14.3 percent higher at 26.36 billion pesetas versus 23.05 billion.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
